891#issuecomment-4979700183","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/airflow/issues/69891","id":4979700183,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAgUK288AAAABKNAx1w","user":{"login":"Shivam-Shukla0","id":186047196,"node_id":"U_kgDOCxba3A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/186047196?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shivam-Shukla0","html_url":"https://github.com/Shivam-Shukla0","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shivam-Shukla0/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shivam-Shukla0/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shivam-Shukla0/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shivam-Shukla0/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shivam-Shukla0/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shivam-Shukla0/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shivam-Shukla0/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shivam-Shukla0/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shivam-Shukla0/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-15T10:48:32Z","updated_at":"2026-07-15T10:48:32Z","body":"Hey @wolfier I'd like to work on this issue.\n\nFrom the description, it looks like the datetime filter \ninput commits its value on every keystroke (updating the \nfilter state and triggering a refetch), instead of \ncommitting on blur/Enter or after the input is a complete, \nvalid date. That would explain both the odd displayed value \n(partial input being parsed as a date) and the constant \nrefreshing.\n\nMy plan:\n1. Reproduce locally (Breeze + UI dev server)\n2. Locate the date/time filter component in the UI code\n3. Fix the commit behavior (defer to blur/Enter or debounce, \n   whichever is consistent with the rest of the filters)\n4. Attach before/after screen recordings with the PR\n\nCould a maintainer please assign this to me?","author_